# Findings that are intentional for this playground, with justification.
# Anything NOT listed here at HIGH/CRITICAL severity fails the CI scan.

# The web server is deliberately public over HTTP — that is the point of the
# playground stack. Do not carry this pattern into production without a load
# balancer + TLS in front.
AVD-AWS-0107

# Unrestricted egress from the web server SG: acceptable for a short-lived
# playground instance that needs to reach package mirrors on first boot.
AVD-AWS-0104

# The public subnet auto-assigns public IPs — required so the web server is
# reachable without a NAT/ALB, which would triple the cost of the playground.
AVD-AWS-0164

# The state bucket is encrypted with the AWS-managed KMS key rather than a
# customer-managed key. A CMK adds cost and key-policy management for no real
# benefit in a throwaway playground account.
AVD-AWS-0132
